1927 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Key Findings\072\n\nThe modifier system was the single largest point of failure\056 Roughly 8\05510 of 15 participants could not successfully customize a drink using the app\047s built\055in modifier controls\056\nUsers consistently bypassed the modifier system by typing customizations into the special instructions field\054 only to hit an undisclosed character limit\056\nThe recommendations section dominated the screen and prevented users from finding the main menu\054 with some participants spending up to 5 minutes searching\056\nIngredient and allergen information was unintuitive\054 a gap with both usability and potential liability implications\056\nThe cart and checkout flow was the most consistently successful task across all sessions\056\n\nPrimary Recommendation\072 Redesign the modifier interaction to use clearer visual affordances and tap feedback\054 reduce the visual dominance of the recommendations section\054 and surface ingredient information at the point of product selection\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 1928 0 R
     /Pg 514 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1928 0 obj
  << /K [ 1927 0 R ]
     /P 1933 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 514 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1929 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This study evaluated the usability of the Philz Coffee mobile ordering app through moderated testing sessions conducted with 15 participants across five facilitator groups\056 Participants were tested on both iOS and Android devices\054 with some comparison sessions on the web interface\056 The goal was to identify friction points in the mobile ordering experience\054 with particular attention to whether users could understand and effectively interact with the app\047s touch\055based controls\056\n\nStudy Parameters\072\n\n15 participants across 5 facilitator groups \050Stacy\054 Tarun\054 Liz\054 Paige\054 James\051\nPlatforms\072 iOS\054 Android\054 Web\n5 tasks per session\072 find\057download the app\054 select a store location\054 customize an order using modifiers\054 place a drink order with special instructions\054 manage the cart and check out)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1930 0 R
     /Pg 514 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

